An optional field the lens moves into a required one, under another name:
the move is refused (E0343), and the field is not then reported as one
nothing maps, since the lens does map it.
-- ship/history/0.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:     string
	owner?: string
}
-- ship/history/1.0.thema --
Schema: {
	id:   string
	lead: string
}

ForwardLens: {
	v0_0: _
	v1_0: {
		id:   v0_0.id
		lead: v0_0.owner
	}
}
-- ship/tip.thema --
Schema: {
	id:   string
	lead: string
}
-- out/error --
error[E0343]: owner is optional in v0.0 and v1.0 requires lead
  --> history/1.0.thema:10:3
   |
10 |         lead: v0_0.owner
   |         ^^^^
   |
   = help: write _coalesce(v0_0.owner, <fallback>) to say what to use when it is absent
